The metro train arrives at the junction station.
That woman's instruction is right.
I alight from the metro train here.
This station is very busy.
There are many people here.
I need to get to the new train.
I look up.
There are coloured signs there.
I follow the blue sign.
I walk along a long corridor.
Soon, I reach the new platform.
Many people are waiting here too.
I stand behind the yellow line.
The second metro train arrives quickly.
The doors of the train open.
People go out of the train.
Then I safely board the new metro train.
The new train arrives here.
Now I travel by this metro train.
